WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:04.810
Here and now I shall obliterate
all that can perturb me.

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:08.730
Come, let us start the final party!

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.740
Mister!

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.240
I etch out today with my finger

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:57.660
on the dusty hood of a car

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:01.120
As the rain shower passed over,

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.960
it vanished just like love

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:11.210
There's something in your heart you can't get rid of

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:17.890
So beat your invisible wings

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:21.760
We'll fight back against the wind

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.560
that gusts at us so relentlessly

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.980
We'll stand firm against it

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.820
with steadfast emotion! Go!

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:38.740
We continue running on our way

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:44.750
to a place promised, where sandstorms whirl

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:47.870
Tonight is the night

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:51.380
We're gonna make it through

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:57.090
On to our destination!

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:11.400
Episode 12

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:16.780
Marciano!

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:24.040
Bruce's legacy of ten billion space dollars is in here!

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:25.950
I'll give you the money.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:29.170
In return, let us go as we are.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.090
Would that be before this planet ceases to exist?

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.630
So you know?

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:43.140
You sound as though you've already
accomplished what you came here for.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:49.440
With the number of troops you've got, you'd
probably be able to carry it all out in time.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:58.280
A business deal is something that happens when
each party wants something the other has.

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:00.530
This is Bruce's legacy, honey!

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:04.450
I have come here to settle a score.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:09.790
I trust you have as well, Mister.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:16.420
I will kill you and then make his legacy mine.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.720
It's...

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:26.890
Showtime!

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:42.490
Two hours left until the
photonic bomb is detonated.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:47.120
How is the evacuation of our troops proceeding?

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:55.000
Mr. President, we have already
evacuated 97% of our forces.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.420
Incidentally, we have also received
a report that today alone,

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:03.300
over three hundred Graceland Liberation Forces
craft have evacuated the planet.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.010
Did they find out?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.470
But Mr. President,

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:10.810
are you certain it's okay to detonate
the photonic bomb?

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:15.520
What choice do we have? It's the Liberation Forces
that have driven us to this point.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:16.860
But sir...

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.070
I see no alternatives.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:23.910
They destroyed the remote control
device on their own too.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.630
There should be a long-range
communications device somewhere.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.250
We'll split up and search!

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:48.350
Have to hurry... Communications device,
communications device...

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.450
Hands in the air!

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.240
Don't shoot!

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.740
What are you doing here?!

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:12.910
What am I doing? I stayed behind
to delete the data.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:13.960
Who are you?

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.290
I'm in charge of this facility!

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.960
And who are you?

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:21.000
I am Angelica Burns, Federal inspector.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.630
I am searching for a communications device.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.170
Please cooperate with me.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.630
I want to speak directly to the
president immediately.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.510
There's no way you can do that!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.310
I'm getting out of here right away!

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:33.560
Let's go together.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:36.480
I'll shoot! Where is the communications device?

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.150
I want to have a word with the
president immediately!

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.690
That is clearly impossible!

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:45.200
Then you only need to connect me to his office.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.030
Don't tell me it's not possible.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:52.330
All Federation bases are required to have
a direct line to the president's office.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.830
I mean it.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.340
Mother, I am sorry we're late!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:20.020
The place is gonna collapse!

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.440
Mother?!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:27.950
Mister!

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:50.550
So this will really take us to where Mister is?

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:56.810
Bruce told me that the water veins
under Godwing are connected.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.020
But we can take them all the way
to Gigabanks, right?

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.940
How the hell should I know'?

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:04.150
If we can at least get close,
I guess we'll figure something out.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:39.020
Huh?

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.770
What is it, Pops?

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:43.440
I'm getting a signal for Gigabanks
coming from right above us.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.900
Are you serious?

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.480
That can't be right.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:48.400
Is the compass broken or something?

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:55.200
Katana!

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:08.000
Gigabanks!

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:11.340
Mister and Franca! Then...

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.050
Right on the money!

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.800
All right!

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.140
Boss!

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:23.850
Get in, Franca!

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.230
Okay!

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:26.520
What about you?

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:29.190
I'll be there right after, so wait up for me.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.570
All right!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:45.630
I will not let you go!

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:58.720
Do it, Swamp!

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.310
Just leave it to me!

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.320
Mother!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.700
I'd say the tables have turned, Marciano.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:22.290
I won't allow my pride

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.080
and my way of life to be denied
by the likes of you people!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:45.810
At this rate, we're going to bite the dust here.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:51.190
Bringing you down is more important to me.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:52.400
Oh, is it?

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:55.110
Then I guess I've got no choice but to go

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:55.950
all out!

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:20.970
You Coyotes... I despise your very existence.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:26.020
To think that if there'd been another
life for me outside of the Guild...

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:31.440
To think that if I had been able to bear children...

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:38.070
I'll kill you, and cut away all my lingering regrets!

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:41.870
Why do you give in to hatred like you do?

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:47.160
Dragging all that baggage along with you
will only tire you out.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.960
I will not...

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:54.460
I will not stand for any Coyote sullying my pride!

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:58.800
You're a sad story, Marciano.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:00.840
Mister!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.350
I'll tell ya about Coyotes!

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:12.270
They drink together!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.190
They share their dreams with each other!

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.900
They trust in their kin!

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.860
They put their lives on the line for their comrades!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.840
That... That's a Coyote.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:56.480
<i>Angelica?! What are you doing on Graceland?!</i>

00:11:56.480 --> 00:12:00.450
Mr. President, please tell me where the
photonic bomb has been buried.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.700
There's just enough time for me
to make it if I act now.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.370
<i>Photonic bomb...</i>

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.330
<i>Angelica, you mean to tell me you...</i>

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.000
Hurry! There's no time to lose!

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:12.040
<i>But even if you get to the bomb, how will you...</i>

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.290
The Coyotes will be able to handle it.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:15.880
<i>Coyotes?</i>

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.130
Just tell me, quickly!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.760
If you don't tell me, then I will
take your secret public.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.510
About how you were also originally a Guild...

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:31.270
<i>No... Now just hold on a minute, Angelica!</i>

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:34.400
Please tell me where the bomb has been buried,

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:35.940
Mr. President.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:52.290
Mother...

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.500
Mister!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.710
What, Franca?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.260
Did you think they were going to
finish me off or something?

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:05.340
Nuh-uh...

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.810
<i>Mister! Mister! Get up here quick!</i>

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:14.440
What's up?

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.400
Prepare for a shock.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:17.940
I'm putting Mister on now.

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:20.610
Angelica?!

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:23.440
<i>I found out where the photonic bomb is buried.</i>

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.110
You did?

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:28.450
<i>There's just over an hour left.</i>

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:30.790
<i>What will you do?</i>

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:34.660
<i>No one will blame you if you choose
to leave the planet now.</i>

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.040
<i>It's your call...</i>

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:39.920
<i>Mister.</i>

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:50.720
Ah, cripes! That Bruce sure stuck us
with one pain in the ass of a legacy.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.270
Mister?

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.860
This will be the last party on our journey!

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:08.320
All right!

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:12.410
Angelica, where's the photonic bomb located?

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:18.080
<i>Underneath Godwing, at coordinates E0083, N0080.</i>

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:22.630
<i>The cancellation code is E-L-V-l-S-0-8-2.</i>

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.590
Punch those in for me, Bishop.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.300
I'm already on it.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.800
Okay.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.220
Thank you, Angelica.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:36.730
All right, the coordinates have been entered.

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:39.100
I'm sending them to you, Katana!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.230
You tellin' me it's even farther down?!

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.150
Will we make it, Katana?

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:45.740
Of course we will!

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:48.860
This is Master Katana's
Super Highspeed Express, man!

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:19.870
It's morning!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:22.580
And it's a beautiful one! Goddamn!

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:32.380
We're already past the time, right?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.340
Most likely.

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.890
Then we can assume that Mister and his gang
halted the detonation sequence, right?

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:05.080
Somethings approaching us from ahead.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:06.130
Huh?

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:11.670
That's...

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.590
Marciano...

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.390
I will not be defeated...

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:25.020
I will not be defeated!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.910
Katana, turn us around.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:48.540
<i>Hoho o tsutawaru
Where are these waterdrops</i>

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.290
Mister!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:50.710
Marciano wants to settle things once and for all.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:58.180
<i>shizuku doko kara kuru no
that travel along my cheek coming from?</i>

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:03.600
<i>Oshiete...
Tell me...</i>

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.730
This will be a one-round match.

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:16.530
<i>Makimodosenai jikan to iu ruuru ni 
I grabbed the rule that says we cant turn back time</i>

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:07.730
All right, then.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:09.060
Let's do it!

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:11.190
Marciano!

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:24.700
<i>munagura tsukanda
by the collar</i>

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.330
MISTER!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:28.420
<i>Koko ni aru "omoi" de sae
I resist the fading memories</i>

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:39.090
<i>usuragu kioku ni teikou suru keredo
even with the feelings here</i>

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:42.600
<i>Kitto koroshi ni kuru
But I'm sure they'll come to kill me</i>

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:49.190
<i>Sugite kita hibi no naka de
From out of all the days that have gone by</i>

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:57.650
<i>Tatta hitotsu shinjirareru
There's only one thing I can believe in</i>

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:52.070
She was...

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:55.940
Marciano was a Coyote too,

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:03.990
<i>Koe o karasete naita
I cried until my voice was hoarse</i>

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.910
though we were never able to have a drink together.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:07.330
<i>Koko e kite
Come to me</i>

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:11.000
<i>Soba ni ite
Be by my side</i>

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.630
<i>Nee
Okay?</i>

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:30.020
This planet has been saved, huh?

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:33.650
Thanks to those Coyotes.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.650
That's what it amounts to.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.700
It's heartrending! It's so sad!

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:40.410
Where did that come from?

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:42.240
Well, I mean it's amazing, isn't it?

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:43.990
They put their lives on the line for all!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:46.830
And yet, no one knows a thing about it.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.790
No one will give them any
recognition or praise for it.

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.040
They'll still be seen as mere criminals.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.090
Don't be silly.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:58.300
Man, I'm starving!

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:00.300
Again?!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.300
These should do for now.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:16.230
Mister and those Coyotes saved Graceland
because Coyotes are what they are.

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:17.900
That's all.

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:21.240
You're right.

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:23.820
<i>"Coyote"...</i>

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:26.410
It has such a nice ring to it, don't you think?

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:34.710
I accept the criticism regarding
the photonic bomb bluff.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:36.540
But the ultimate truth behind this action

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:43.590
is that the precious lives of Graceland's one million
plus inhabitants have thus been spared.

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:47.850
<i>That is why, as a politician, I
take pride in my decision.</i>

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:50.640
<i>A recent public opinion poll indicates</i>

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:54.100
<i>that a growing number of people are rating
the president's skills in bringing this war to the end</i>

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.360
<i>while keeping the number of lives
lost to a minimum highly.</i>

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:02.240
Hey man, let's go hunting for gold next.

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.820
There's twenty tons of gold bullion
that got shipwrecked...

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:07.700
On a snowy-ass mountain, right?

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:08.870
Too cold for me, thanks.

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:12.250
Okay then, there's also someone
smuggling some Da Vinci...

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.370
Paintings are of no interest to me, thanks!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.750
Well, then...

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:19.170
We're going back to repair my church first,
isn't that right?

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:21.260
C'mon now, Swamp.

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:24.630
Ain't it all right to make a few
little stops along the way?

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:29.810
Besides, all that submerged money we collected
oughta cover the cost of repairs to your church.

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:35.020
By the way, I heard there's a single
case of a legendary whiskey

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:39.190
stashed away in a certain place on Scotch.

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:41.030
Now dontcha feel like going to drink some of that?

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:42.610
-Whiskey?

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:45.240
That's got nothing to do with me!

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:48.700
I hear that Scotchian cheese, which the planet
is so famous for, is most delectable.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.540
Cheese, huh?

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:52.620
Well, in that case...

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:55.370
Just a little!

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:57.460
It's decided!

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:09.140
We're still going to Aquaria once
we get back to Ku-Rong, right?

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:11.180
The Babes of the Everlasting Summer
are waitin' for me.

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:12.390
No, they're not.

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:14.980
We'll have to reopen Pirate Hideout too.

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:16.440
I've already thought up a new menu!

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:17.770
Hey, that's right!

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:19.520
All the boys are probably starving
their <i>asses</i> off waiting for us.

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:22.320
And right about now, all the ladies are probably crying themselves to sleep waiting for me to come home!

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:23.900
Well, say something, dammit!

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:26.860
I don't care what, just gimme
some good booze to drink!

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:30.070
I keep telling you that the
church repairs come first!

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:32.910
Okay! I say we do all that stuff!

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:34.620
Hell yeah! Let's do it, man!

00:22:34.620 --> 00:22:36.160
Katana! Get a grip!

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:42.750
Hokorimamire no bonnet
I etch out today with my finger

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:46.380
yubi de kyou o kizamu
on the dusty hood of a car

00:22:46.380 --> 00:22:49.680
Toori ame ga sugiru koro
As the rain shower passed over

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:52.680
ai no you ni kieta
it vanished just like love

00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:59.690
Kokoro no naka suterenu mono aru kara
There's something in your heart you can't toss out

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:06.150
mienai tobira kojiakete
so wrench open that unseen door

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:13.280
Koredemo katto fuku kaze ni mukaiuchi
We'll fight back against the wind that gusts at us so relentlessly

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:20.250
Yuruginai kimochi de tachimukatteku no sa go!
We'll stand firm against it with steadfast emotion! Go!

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:26.510
Subete nomikonde shimau sekai to
Even if we know the world will swallow it all,

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:33.970
sunabokori mau yakusoku no basho e
even if we can't see the end of the darkness,

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:41.100
kurayami ni hate mienakutemo hashitteku no sa go!
we run on to a place promised where sandstorms whirl! Go!

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:48.110
Sunabokori mau yakusoku no basho e
We continue running on our way

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:54.200
oretachi wa hashiritsuzukete yuku
to a place promised, where sandstorms whirl

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:57.620
Konya koso
Tonight is the night

00:23:57.620 --> 00:24:04.840
Ano saki made
On to our destination
